rcu()\n- ipv4: use RCU protection in __ip_rt_update_pmtu() {CVE-2025-21766}\n- ipv6: use RCU protection in ip6_default_advmss() {CVE-2025-21765}\n- fix: ndisc: use RCU protection in ndisc_alloc_skb() {CVE-2025-21764}\n- neighbour: use RCU protection in __neigh_notify() {CVE-2025-21763}\n- arp: use RCU protection in arp_xmit() {CVE-2025-21762}\n- openvswitch: use RCU protection in ovs_vport_cmd_fill_info() {CVE-2025-21761}\n- ndisc: extend RCU protection in ndisc_send_skb() {CVE-2025-21760}\n- ipv6: mcast: extend RCU protection in igmp6_send() {CVE-2025-21759}\n- ipv6: mcast: add RCU protection to mld_newpack() {CVE-2025-21758}\n- ipv4: use RCU protection in rt_is_expired()\n- ipv4: use RCU protection in inet_select_addr()\n- ipv4: add RCU protection to ip4_dst_hoplimit()\n- flow_dissector: use RCU protection to fetch dev_net()\n- net: add dev_net_rcu() helper\n- net: treat possible_net_t net pointer as an RCU one and add read_pnet_rcu()\n- Revert \"net: add dst_dev_rcu() helper for safe dst->dev access\"\n- Revert \"net: use dst_dev_rcu() in sk_setup_caps() {CVE-2025-40170}\"\n- Revert \"ipv6: use RCU for dst->dev access in ip6_xmit, ip6_output, ip6_finish_output2 {CVE-2025-40135} {CVE-2025-40158}\"\n- nvmet-tcp: propagate nvmet_tcp_build_pdu_iovec() errors to its callers {CVE-2026-23112}\n- Buffer overflow in drivers/xen/sys-hypervisor.c {CVE-2026-31786}\n- xen/privcmd: fix double free via VMA splitting {CVE-2026-31787}\n- dlm: validate length in dlm_search_rsb_tree {CVE-2026-43125}\n- nvmet-tcp: add bounds checks in nvmet_tcp_build_pdu_iovec {CVE-2026-23112}\n- NFSv4: include MAY_WRITE in open permission mask for O_TRUNC {CVE-2026-64298}\n- fuse: re-lock request before returning from fuse_ref_folio() {CVE-2026-64266}\n- drop_monitor: fix size calculations for 64-bit attributes {CVE-2026-68287}\n- sctp: don't free the ASCONF's own transport in DEL-IP processing {CVE-2026-64564}","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bpftool","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.5","purl":"pkg:r